1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,362
Just this once. Three of the most expensive words you can say.

2
00:00:05,712 --> 00:00:11,120
One skipped workout. One extra snack. One late night. Each one feels tiny.

3
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:18,646
But just this once, every day, adds up. One snack a day is three hundred sixty five snacks a year.

4
00:00:20,096 --> 00:00:25,512
And every time you say it, it gets easier to say again. Your brain learns the shortcut.

5
00:00:26,762 --> 00:00:31,547
So next time, don't ask, is it just this once? Ask, do I want this every day?

6
00:00:32,897 --> 00:00:35,676
What's your just this once? Tell me in the comments.

7
00:00:37,326 --> 00:00:40,218
Follow me for more delayed gratification tips.

